msgid ""
"Before anything is written, xbps runs a dry run. The plan shows the "
"packages, the actions and the exact bytes to download and install."
msgstr ""
"Antes de escribir nada, xbps hace un ensayo. El plan muestra los paquetes, "
"las acciones y los bytes exactos que se descargan e instalan."

